							"paragraphStyle" : {
								"__type" : "textStyle"
							},
							"string" : "Focus on creating only the immediate namespace, without the parent scope.\nMost probably we'll need to find the {{gtClass:KotlinIdentifierNode}} and create the namespace on the MooseModel.\n\nThen we'll need to assign the namespace to the class."
						},
